---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Astrid Zhao" description="Learn about Astrid Zhao's engineering background, curiosity, teaching, and community work.">
  <div class="stack gap-20">
    <main class="wrapper about">
      <Hero title="Beyond the code" tagline="Curious builder, thoughtful engineer, lifelong learner.">
        <img width="1553" height="873" src="/assets/schoolphoto.JPG" alt="Astrid's college experience" />
      </Hero>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">My story</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>I'm Astrid (Ziyin) Zhao, a New York-based software engineer and Technology Associate at Morgan Stanley. I work on regulatory reporting infrastructure and agentic AI tools that help engineers investigate difficult problems and make better-informed decisions.</p>
          <p>Building RRE.ai deepened my interest in a question that goes beyond model accuracy: how can AI and human experts work together to make better decisions, especially when mistakes matter? I enjoy turning hard, real-world problems into working systems—and learning from the limitations those systems reveal.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p><strong>Morgan Stanley · Technology Associate</strong> (2024–present). Engineering reliable capital-markets regulatory reporting systems; building agentic diagnostics and specification-driven validation tools.</p>
          <p><strong>Morgan Stanley · Software Engineering Intern</strong> (summer 2023). Built Java/Spring and Apache Camel integrations for order-activity file transformation and prototyped AI-assisted trade-metrics retrieval.</p>
          <p><a href="/resume/">Explore my full experience and skills →</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p><strong>Mount Holyoke College</strong> · B.A. in Computer Science and Data Science, minor in Statistics (2023). GPA: 3.92/4.00; magna cum laude; Mu Sigma Rho Statistics Honor Society.</p>
          <p>I also studied at AIT Budapest, exploring deep learning and computational problem-solving.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Outside of engineering</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>Teaching and community-building matter to me. I spent three years supporting students in computer science and quantitative courses, mentor with Girls Who Code, and contribute to technology for the Bonjour Girls women's community.</p>
          <p>I joined my college's equestrian team as a beginner and went on to place in the top ten at the 2022 IHSA national competition. I also love writing, exploring cities, and bringing people together.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <ContactCTA />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3.5rem}
  img{margin-top:1.5rem;border-radius:1.5rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
  section{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.8rem;color:var(--gray-200)}
  .section-title{grid-column-start:1;font-size:var(--text-xl);color:var(--gray-0)}
  .content{grid-column:2 / 4;display:grid;gap:1rem}
  .content a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.25em}
  @media(min-width:50em){.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 60% 1fr}.about>:first-child{grid-column-start:2}section{display:contents;font-size:var(--text-lg)}}
</style>
